{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50869","headline":"省题诗二十一首 山明松雪 · 王棨","name":"省题诗二十一首 山明松雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高树录轩晓，长松带雪明。\n景疑残月在，林似野云横。\n密叶缘多亚，修条被压倾。\n曙空连嶂白，寒气到檐清。\n影杂青牛重，光迷皓鹤惊。\n披衣凝望久，无限剡溪情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王棨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50869.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50869","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}